    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    Practical proof formats that work across almost every track above: a published op-ed or working
    paper beyond your dissertation, a policy brief written to a real think tank's or ministry's
    format, a conference presentation outside your own university, an internship or short-term
    consultancy with a think tank, an international body, or an election-research firm, and a public
    archive of your writing — even a simple newsletter — tracking your specialisation consistently.
  </p>

